{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:bb6e4c6121d5d570","name":"Jedi Healer","source":{"id":"source:reference-bb6e4c6121d5d570","title":"Jedi Healer","revision":26702,"timestamp":"2025-06-09T03:42:39Z","sha256":"5e766565405a46099cf905c3be28d441a58ccd5192ea957db2151c166316b6b9","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=26702","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Jedi%20Healer&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-bb6e4c6121d5d570","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Clone Wars Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Clone_Wars_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Affiliations: ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Jedi"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Jedi","referenceId":"reference:d320edb17de6c558"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Like many religions and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Traditions"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Traditions","referenceId":"reference:da4e2621bc8ff060"}," in the galaxy, ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Jedi Order"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Jedi_Order"}," values life and its preservation, and life in turn creates ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"},". To that end, the ability to channel ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"}," to heal is one of the most prized powers a Jedi can possess. Although many Jedi learn to treat wounds to some extent, few Jedi devote their lives to the healing arts. Those that specialize in this area find that their understanding of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"}," increases when they heal the sick and tend to the wounded.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Jedi Healers are experts in the field of medicine. They spend a majority of their time tending to patients and expanding their understanding of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"}," by studying its connection with all living things. Since anger and aggression hamper their healing abilities, Jedi Healers are less likely to be tempted by ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Dark Side"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Dark_Side"}," of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"},". Many great instructors and philosophers of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Jedi Order"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Jedi_Order"}," throughout history were also Healers. Any younglings that show an interest or natural ability with healing are carefully tutored to take up the mantle of a Jedi Healer to keep their abilities from going to waste. \n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Despite their devotion to the preservation of life, Jedi Healers are not pacifists. Many of them are more than willing to use their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsabers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsabers","referenceId":"reference:420c60d0a682943a"}," to defend the sick and helpless. Jedi Healers actively seek out battlefields, plague-ridden worlds, and highly dangerous locales to donate their time and abilities to help those in need.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["During ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Clone Wars"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Clone_Wars"},", the Republic encourages Jedi Healers to accompany troops onto battlefields. Citizens unfortunate enough to be caught in the middle of battle often benefit from Jedi Healers passing through.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Jedi Healer Statistics (CL 9)"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Human"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Medium "